            <div xml:id="d1290">

                <pb facs="0883" n="767" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg767"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/32.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consular Agent Taylor.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 13, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Treaty of 1831 no longer in force. Report to Department if there is any apparent
                    illegal procedure or discrimination against foreigners in connection with levy
                    of taxes by local authorities; also if nationals of any country are exempted
                    from payment of taxes by virtue of treaty provisions or otherwise.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
